01:55:58.027 --> 01:55:58.587
Oh, no.

01:55:58.587 --> 01:56:02.507
So there's a great example. If you don't
understand how the system works, you're

01:56:02.567 --> 01:56:03.887
gonna make, you're gonna come to wrong

01:56:03.927 --> 01:56:06.667
conclusions about how to help. You're gonna
come to wrong conclusions about,

01:56:07.147 --> 01:56:10.147
um, about what's going on. You're gonna
flag the wrong people

01:56:10.527 --> 01:56:13.847
for needing help. You're gonna, you're gonna
miss who does need help, you know?

01:56:14.047 --> 01:56:17.827
All these things. Uh, so I think pragmatically
understanding how these systems work and how

01:56:17.887 --> 01:56:21.507
genes and environment work together and how it's a s-
