It d- mean, I don't know their heart
health or their, uh,

01:56:28.427 --> 01:56:31.047
you know, mental health or anything like that.
It, those are different traits.

01:56:31.047 --> 01:56:34.527
There is clearly need and value

01:56:35.207 --> 01:56:36.967
in population level research.

01:56:36.967 --> 01:56:37.727
Mm-hmm.

01:56:37.727 --> 01:56:39.827
Uh, this is, again, your field.

01:56:39.827 --> 01:56:40.047
Yeah.

01:56:40.047 --> 01:56:41.067
At least your old field

01:56:41.887 --> 01:56:42.367
on that.

01:56:43.167 --> 01:56:47.127
What you're clearly arguing for, though, here, is at
