02:05:05.419 --> 02:05:06.359
Yeah. I, um,

02:05:07.399 --> 02:05:11.959
I think that my time as an EMT, uh,
was motivated by

02:05:12.119 --> 02:05:13.919
two big things. You know, it's, you
never know, you,

02:05:14.059 --> 02:05:17.159
you sort of, we, we tell our stor- stories about
