That was, that's super cool.

02:05:43.299 --> 02:05:43.619
Yeah.

02:05:43.619 --> 02:05:45.719
Uh, but the other thing was, you know,

02:05:46.779 --> 02:05:51.199
medicine and especially emergency medicine happens
behind closed doors for most of us.

02:05:51.199 --> 02:05:51.519
Yep.

02:05:51.519 --> 02:05:54.559
