02:06:23.439 --> 02:06:27.639
the immediacy of it, the fact that it's something that
most of the w- that I never got to see

02:06:28.459 --> 02:06:29.739
growing up, um,

02:06:31.219 --> 02:06:35.219
yeah, it wa- the, that was the draw. And, and, you
